{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SnQFpTeJsGTMhCw5xzgvce","type":"tool_result","content":"59:The browser hub's docs and scripts describe a bdg and a Code Mode that no longer behave that way. Readers copy `bdg cdp` calls with positional JSON, which bdg 0.6.10 rejects. They also copy Code Mode blocks with top-level `await`, which the wrapper refuses, and run `install.sh`, which finds no Chrome on macOS. A request to attach to the operator's own Chrome also routed nowhere.\n120:| REQ-001 | No doc in scope passes JSON to `bdg cdp` as a positional argument | `rg \"bdg cdp [A-Za-z]+\\.[A-Za-z]+ ['\\\"{]\"` over the topic scope and hub root prints nothing |","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"<redacted>","uuid":"<redacted>","timestamp":"2026-11-24T04:47:22.154Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"59:The browser hub's docs and scripts describe a bdg and a Code Mode that no longer behave that way. Readers copy `bdg cdp` calls with positional JSON, which bdg 0.6.10 rejects. They also copy Code Mode blocks with top-level `await`, which the wrapper refuses, and run `install.sh`, which finds no Chrome on macOS. A request to attach to the operator's own Chrome also routed nowhere.\n120:| REQ-001 | No doc in scope passes JSON to `bdg cdp` as a positional argument | `rg \"bdg cdp [A-Za-z]+\\.[A-Za-z]+ ['\\\"{]\"` over the topic scope and hub root prints nothing |","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01SnQFpTeJsGTMhCw5xzgvce","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
