{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019SZv9P1kSAgvyFkMdwLv9d","type":"tool_result","content":"29:              terminal_stop_reason = reason when it is maxIterationsReached, maxDurationReached, manualStop or error; blockedStop when decision is STOP and reason is blockedStop; else \"converged\". Read reason, never stopReason: every manual stop sets reason to manualStop while stopReason may still hold blockedStop or stuckRecovery\n30-            outputs:\n31-              - terminal_gate_results_json: \"Tool terminal_gate_results_json: three rows {gateId, status, reasonCode, evidenceDigest} in the order evidence, scope, coverage\"\n32-              - failed_required_gate_ids: \"Tool failed_required_gate_ids: the gateIds whose status is fail, in that order; [] when all pass\"\n33-              - terminal_stop_reason: \"From evaluate\"\n34-            append_jsonl: '{\"stem\":\"deep_review.terminal_gates_recorded\",\"scope\":{\"runId\":\"{session_id}\",\"sessionId\":\"{session_id}\",\"generation\":{generation},\"iterationId\":\"iteration-{current_iteration}\"},\"data\":{\"stopReason\":\"{terminal_stop_reason}\",\"gateResults\":{terminal_gate_results_json},\"failedRequiredGateIds\":{failed_required_gate_ids},\"appendPosition\":{current_iteration}}}'\n35-            log: \"Terminal gates recorded at stop {terminal_stop_reason}. Failed required gates: {failed_required_gate_ids}\"\n36-          branch_on: \"convergence_mode == 'divergent' AND stop_decision.reasonDetail == 'all_dimensions_clean'\"\n37-          if_divergent_eligible:\n38-            eligibility_contract:\n39-              required_decision: \"STOP\"\n40-              eligible_reasons: [all_dimensions_clean]\n41:              excluded_reasons: [maxIterationsReached, blockedStop, stuckRecovery, error, manualStop, userPaused, maxDurationReached]\n42-              fail_closed: \"Any missing or ambiguous reason uses if_existing_terminal_path without preparing a pivot. The nine legal-stop gates have already run and remain unchanged.\"\n43-              frontier_gate: \"Under depth_mode == 'expansive' the pivot is eligible only once registry.frontier holds no open or active node. The frontierOpen stop veto already returns CONTINUE while one is open, so this gate records the order rather than adding a second check. A candidate the pivot accepts becomes next_dimension through pivot_result.restoredFocus; with the frontier terminal the leaf gets no FRONTIER block, so the pivot adds no frontier node. The pivot may seed from nodes closed exhausted or blocked.\"\n44-            steps:\n45-              step_prepare_divergent_pivot:\n46-                action: \"Generate state-grounded read-only review candidates and prepare or resume the pivot transaction\"\n47-                dry_run_boundary: \"state-mutation\"\n48-                command: |\n49-                  node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/divergent-pivot.cjs prepare --loop-type review --artifact-root \"{state_paths.packet_dir}\" --config \"{state_paths.config}\" --state-log \"{state_paths.state_log}\" --strategy \"{state_paths.strategy}\" --registry \"{state_paths.findings_registry}\" --current-iteration \"{current_iteration}\" --max-iterations \"{max_iterations}\" --trigger-reason \"{reason_detail}\"\n50-                working_directory: \"{repo_root}\"\n51-                outputs:\n52-                  - pivot_prepare_json: \"The complete parsed JSON result\"\n53-                  - pivot_prepare_status: \"status from the prepare result\"\n--\n212:        if_stuck_recovery:\n213:          log: \"Stuck detected ({stuck_count} consecutive no-progress, counted per frontier node under expansive depth). Entering recovery.\"\n214-          recovery_strategies:\n215-            - \"Change granularity: file-level → function-level → line-level review\"\n216-            - \"Traceability protocol replay: re-run unresolved core or overlay checks\"\n217-            - \"Escalate severity review: re-examine P2 findings for potential P1 upgrades\"\n218-          pivot_target: \"Pivot to the least-covered dimension (the review dimension with the fewest iteration passes and lowest coverage ratio).\"\n219-          set:\n220-            next_dimension: \"RECOVERY: {recovery_strategy}. Least-covered dimension: {least_explored}\"\n221:            pending_stop_event: \"stuck_recovery\"\n222:            pending_stop_reason: \"stuckRecovery\"\n223-            pending_stop_detail: \"Recovery path activated after repeated no-progress iterations\"\n224-          if_expansive_open_node:\n225-            when: \"depth_mode == 'expansive' AND active_frontier_node is non-empty\"\n226:            note: \"The recovery path still sets pending_stop_event stuck_recovery, which step_normalize_pause_events appends as deep_review.recovery_started. The next node needs no reset from it: its stuckCount counts only its own iterations.\"\n227:            command: 'node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/frontier-admit.cjs close --target review --artifact-dir \"{artifact_dir}\" --node-id \"{active_frontier_node}\" --status exhausted --reason stuck --iteration \"{current_iteration}\"'\n228-            then_command: \"node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/reduce-state.cjs {spec_folder} {reducer_artifact_arg} --create-missing-anchors\"\n229-            working_directory: \"{repo_root}\"\n230:            log: \"Stuck on frontier node {active_frontier_node}; closed it as exhausted and moved to the next open node.\"\n231-            note_rebind: \"active_frontier_node was bound before this close. Rebind it from the refreshed registry so step_frontier_activate and the dispatch name the next open node, not the one just closed, which close now refuses to reopen.\"\n232-            set:\n233-              active_frontier_node: \"registry.frontier.activeNodeId from the refreshed {state_paths.findings_registry}; an empty string when it is null\"\n234-